      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"cunning of a goblin\" or \"goblin's lair\"? I'm asking for actual legal strategy for a real estate case. Can you just stay on the municipal code and tell me the specific administrative steps or variance processes used in Austin for these types of easement conflicts?",
